    sa: ["Summarise the main principles for reading prophecy responsibly.", ["christ", "context", "genre", "humble", "no dates", "hope"], "A good answer says read prophecy in context and genre, centre it on Christ, distinguish the clear from the debated, avoid date-setting and speculation, and let it lead to repentance, holiness and hope."],
